    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      203.45,
      397.2,
      240.11
    ],
    "text": "3.The body corporate shall operates exclusively as anot-for profit Organization and it is solely for the benifit ofthe society and its members.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      266.93,
      397.17,
      290.99
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The general objects for which the body corporateis constituted are hereby declared to be\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      304.97,
      397.17,
      341.75
    ],
    "text": "(a)to provide all necessary facilities to the public,having given priority to the development ofeducation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      355.85,
      397.19,
      392.51
    ],
    "text": "(b)to give a helping hand to the renaissance in thefield of agriculture, fisheries and livestockDevelopment;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      406.61,
      397.15,
      430.67
    ],
    "text": "(c)to take constructive measures to build up aphysically and mentally healthiest society;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      444.65,
      397.18,
      468.71
    ],
    "text": "(d)to give a helping hand for development of language,arts, culture, heritage and litrature;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      482.81,
      397.18,
      506.87
    ],
    "text": "(e)to contribute in building up a technologicallycentralized society;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      521.21,
      397.18,
      558.11
    ],
    "text": "(f)to implement socio-welfare programmes with theaim of creating a knowledgeable and strong futureyoung generation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      572.33,
      397.19,
      596.51
    ],
    "text": "(g)to take all other constructive measures in order todevelop the economy of the people; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      610.73,
      397.21,
      634.91
    ],
    "text": "(h)to implement all other necessary activities toachieve the above socio-welfare projects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      649.13,
      397.19,
      673.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1), the Corporation shall ensure that such",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
