      407.85,
      255.43,
      455.14,
      332.54
    ],
    "text": "Bodycorporate toensure noconflict withwork ofMinistry orDepartmentof the CentralGovernment",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      340.39,
      452.86,
      375.02
    ],
    "text": "Managementof the affairsof the bodycorporate",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.45,
      401.87,
      240.47
    ],
    "text": "implementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      253.85,
      401.9,
      326.63
    ],
    "text": "5. The objects of the body corporate shall be carried outin such manner so as not to create any conflict between thework of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment, any Provincial Council or Local GovernmentBodies.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      339.89,
      401.88,
      400.43
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) Subject to the provisions of this Act the bodycorporate shall be carried out by a Board of Management(hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Board\u201d) consisting of suchnumber of office bearers as may be specified by the rulesmade under section 8.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      413.69,
      401.88,
      474.23
    ],
    "text": "(2) (a) The Board of Management of the Foundation thatholds office on the day immediately preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act, shall function as the Board of thebody corporate until the first Board is appointed or elected inthe manner provided for by rules made under section 8.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      487.49,
      401.89,
      522.95
    ],
    "text": "(b) The first Board of the body corporate shall beappointed or elected within one year of the date ofcommencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      536.33,
      401.91,
      599.63
    ],
